WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.160
- We have one more uplifting
story I wanna share.

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.688
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:03.688 --> 00:00:06.850
(upbeat music)
(audience clap)

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:09.450
Martin Luther King said,
"Life's most persistent

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:13.010
and urgent question is, what
are you doing for others?"

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:15.950
This next lesson proves even
the smallest act of kindness

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:17.210
can be life-changing.

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:19.940
Five years ago, Sharon was
homeless and saw a stranger

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:22.130
who looked as if she could
use some cheering up.

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:24.730
So Sharon picked some flowers
and handed them to the woman

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:26.380
along with a butterfly sticker.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.130
The next day that stranger told Sharon

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:29.630
that just before they met,

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:32.270
she'd been planning to commit suicide.

00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:34.800
Woof, it's like I already
knew I was gonna say it,

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.480
but that's hard to say.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:38.920
The flowers and sticker
changed everything.

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:40.510
From that moment on Sharon vowed

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:43.520
she'd do random kind gestures
as often as she could,

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:44.640
you know, as often as possible.

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:47.140
And today, not only is
she back on her feet,

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:50.480
she's the founder of Never
Give Up Never Quit, a charity

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.230
dedicated to her mission.
(audience clap)

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:55.660
We have Sharon on the line
right now watching on WKYC3

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:57.325
Cleveland at 11:00 am.

00:00:57.325 --> 00:00:58.435
(audience cheer and clap)

00:00:58.435 --> 00:00:59.268
Hello, hi.

00:01:01.117 --> 00:01:02.787
- Hey, Kelly Clarkson and everyone.

00:01:02.787 --> 00:01:05.110
- Oh, you look so cute,
like I wanna hug you.

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:08.010
So wait, tell us more about
Never Give Up Never Quit.

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:12.280
- In 2018, we officially became
a charitable organization

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:14.350
of random acts of kindness.

00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:19.160
This came after my season
of homelessness, Kelly.

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:22.860
I drive a motivational
vehicle all over my city.

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:26.830
I travel outside of my
city to other cities

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:30.030
with a team of volunteers.

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:32.600
We pack that truck out, Kelly.

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:36.820
We open it up and we give
random acts of kindness.

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:38.012
Some of the things
- [Kelly] Well done.

00:01:38.012 --> 00:01:40.890
that we give, Kelly, are
motivational T-shirts,

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:45.437
we give food, restaurant gift
cards, hats, gloves, coats,

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:49.820
and we also give our Willy Wonka soaps.

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:51.980
We're the Willy Wonkas of soap, Kelly.

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:52.813
- [Kelly] I love it.

00:01:52.813 --> 00:01:54.530
- And when we go to the shelters, Kelly,

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:57.150
a lot of them have
problems with their skin,

00:01:57.150 --> 00:02:00.180
so I specialize in making medicine soaps.

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:02.300
We use them to fundraise.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:05.250
- Oh, that's such an amazing
thing that you're doing.

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:09.160
So, a lot of your volunteers
pass out the items

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:10.460
while wearing costumes.

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:11.820
So why do they do that?

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:15.050
- So, we began this because
I go to high schools

00:02:15.050 --> 00:02:17.590
and do empowerment presentations, Kelly.

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:20.350
So what we say is one
of my favorite sayings,

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:24.690
don't let nothing or
no one clip your wings.

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:26.269
The honeybee and the butterfly
- [Kelly] Oh, I love that.

00:02:26.269 --> 00:02:28.490
cannot fly without wings

00:02:28.490 --> 00:02:30.670
and if we don't have good thoughts,

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:33.420
if we don't choose to have good thoughts,

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:36.250
we cannot have good mental health, Kelly.

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:39.480
So we encourage the people with our wings

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:43.180
to be careful not to
let anything clip you.

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:44.630
- Oh, I love that.

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:47.340
It's so funny, that's
literally a line in a song

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:49.120
that's like, I'm making for my next album.

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:51.500
It's literally about
you try to clip my wings

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:54.860
and it's such a great thing
because it literally is so true.

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:57.040
'Cause I feel like people
will try and get at you

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:58.940
and it's like, not today, Satan.

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:01.223
I'm keeping both my wings in tact.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.100
Well, thank you so much, Sharon.

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:05.560
I love what you're doing,
we love what you're doing.

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:09.069
I'm liking your posts right now, right?

00:03:09.069 --> 00:03:09.910
- [Sharon] Thank you.

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:10.950
- Well, that's not all.

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:13.890
Our season long partner,
Pilot Pen, makers of G2,

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:15.580
the go-to pen of the Kelly Clarkson show,

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:18.450
Want to honor ultimate
overachievers just like you ma'am.

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:21.170
So, they will be writing you
a check for a thousand dollars

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:22.118
to help out.

00:03:22.118 --> 00:03:25.618
(audience cheer and clap)

